  + [required_before_code_creation] is IR3-S05 fixture plan accepted
  + [required_before_code_creation] is IR3-S06 completion review and implementation activation pack accepted or a future explicit implementation activation review opens bounded implementation
  + [model_route_for_code_creation] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable only after IR3 contracts and fixtures are accepted and implementation task is bounded
  + [deeper_reasoning_required_for_changes] is any change to authority semantics, trace identity, generated output policy, fixture IO policy, implementation file inventory, or safety boundary

  = must: keep implementation code gated until evidence and fixtures are accepted
  = must: preserve deeper reasoning for architecture, authority-boundary, or safety-boundary changes

